[00:52.95]I’m holding on to this world
{"我紧抓着这个世界不放"}
[00:57.82]But somehow everything feels so surreal
{"但不知为何一切都如此虚幻"}
[01:03.32]I’m holding on to thin air
{"我紧抓着稀薄的空气"}
[01:08.20]Until now I can’t tell if you’re there
{"直到现在仍无法确定你是否在那里"}
[01:13.81]My trembling arms and trembling frame
{"我颤抖的双臂与战栗的身躯"}
[01:18.23]Can’t shake my aim can’t shake my game
{"无法动摇我的目标　无法打乱我的节奏"}
[01:26.46]Just let me go
{"就让我走吧"}
[01:36.71]I’m losing control
{"我逐渐失控"}
[02:26.14]Open up your eyes and see
{"睁开你的双眼看清"}
[02:29.79]This whole new reality
{"这全新的现实"}
[02:36.64]My hold on to this dream
{"我对这个梦的执着"}
[02:40.50]Is slipping, I’m bursting at the seams
{"正在消逝　我已濒临崩溃"}
[02:47.17]I just want to be free
{"我只想要自由"}
[02:50.42]From this artificial world I’m in
{"逃离这个我身处的人造世界"}
